RoyaleBot runs a bot you made with RoyaleGym in the Nulls Royale app. It works only
with Nulls Royale and refuses the official game. It distributes no game files: you
bring your own copy of the Nulls Royale app, on your own device. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or representative of Supercell or Nulls.
